    "Reply provides solutions on AWS starting from digital transformation consultancy to managed services. Airwalk Reply, Storm Reply, Data Reply, Comsysto Reply, Concept Reply, Discovery Reply, Retail Reply and Sense Reply are the companies highly specialized on AWS technologies with 1000+ AWS certifications, 130+ projects in the last two years on AWS, 15 certified competencies as Generative AI, Migration, Security, Big Data and Analytics, IoT, Machine Learning, Oracle and DevOps, Industrial Software, SaaS, Financial Services, Retail, MSP program, Automotive and Cloud Operations. Reply implements customer tailored platforms as well as ready solutions with fast time-to-market natively built on the AWS infrastructure.",
